  "title": "Supplementary Table S9. Per-IQR linear mixed-model robustness analysis",
  "panel": "",
  "panel_title": "",
  "notes_before": [],
  "notes_after": [
    "Note. Regression coefficients and standard errors are reported for a one-interquartile-range increase in 1-km 4-year mean EVI or O₃ exposure. Single-exposure models include one exposure, whereas dual-exposure models mutually adjust EVI and O₃. The mutually adjusted 1-km estimates correspond to the prespecified primary analysis (main-text Figure 2); the full set of continuous-exposure models is reported in Supplementary Table S24. Models in this table were fitted by restricted maximum likelihood with model-based standard errors; the prespecified primary estimates in Table S24 use robust sandwich variance, so P values for the same point estimate differ slightly between the two tables.",
    "Abbreviations: BAA, biological age acceleration; CI, confidence interval; EVI, enhanced vegetation index; IQR, interquartile range; O₃, ozone; SE, standard error."
  ],
